<title>USA: J.P. Realty Inc Q4 net shr rises to $0.39.</title>
<headline>J.P. Realty Inc Q4 net shr rises to $0.39.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.39		    $0.36</p>
<p> Net			  6,295		    5,766</p>
<p> Revs			19,013		   17,857</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	16,067		   16,034</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	19,678		   19,727</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.46		    $1.27</p>
<p> Net			 23,370		   18,178</p>
<p> Revs			72,949		   60,950</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	16,048		   14,345</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	19,668		   18,037</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 funds from operations on a fully converted basis were $10.4 million or $0.53 per share, compared to $9.40 million or $0.48 per share for the same period in 1995. For full-year 1996, FFO were $39.1 million or $1.99 per share, compared to $32.1 million or $1.27 per share.</p>
